LinkTitle="Confirm character link for this save"
LinkWarning="Pair this XCOM soldier with the selected Journey character. The Name Beneath activates the character or reuses its original frozen snapshot. Traits and Skills apply automatically; review the result afterward. No soldier baseline is uploaded. This save's pairing cannot be reassigned. To choose again or opt out, load a pre-link save. Loading an older save does not undo online activation."
LinkedTitle="Character linked"
EmptyText="No eligible characters on this page"
NextText="Next page"
PreviousText="Previous page"
ResumeText="Resume this save's pending character link"
FailedText="The Name Beneath could not complete this step: "
