MissingCompanionFeature="This companion build does not support save-authoritative linking. Install companion 0.6.0 and the matching mod (Armory feature 2)."
NotStartedText="The Journey must be Started before linking a character. Use campaign setup in MCM to start and connect an Upcoming Journey, or start it in the portal. Soldier linking never starts a Journey."
LedgerConflictText="This soldier has inconsistent saved link/bonus records. No stats have been reapplied or removed. You can leave this screen and continue playing; use an earlier pre-link save to choose again, or report this issue before attempting a repair. The mod will not guess whether these bonuses are already present."

[UITNBCampaignJourney]
m_strTitle="The Name Beneath - Campaign Journey"
m_strInventoryLabel="Commander traits, skills and effects"
m_strEmptyListTitle="Loading..."
m_strBuy="Select"
LoadingText="Checking the companion and Journey..."
ConnectText="Connect Journey"
DetailsText="Details"
RetryText="Retry connection"
ConfirmationTitle="Connect this campaign to the Journey?"
ConfirmationWarning="Connect this campaign to the displayed Journey and freeze the reviewed commander traits, skills and mappings. One-time rewards apply immediately, once in this saved timeline. Ongoing modifiers affect supported gains and supply drops, not existing stock. No soldier is linked. Save the campaign afterward."
ConnectedText="Commander & Bonuses - saved campaign effects"
SavedText="These are this campaign's saved commander bonuses and penalties. Select each row for its exact effect, one-time or ongoing behavior, and result. No soldier links or online connection are required to view them. Viewing never repeats rewards or refreshes frozen mappings. Loading a pre-association save removes this local association and its benefits, but does not undo online Journey or character state."
NotStartedText="The Journey must be Upcoming or Started before connecting this campaign. XCOM never changes its lifecycle without your explicit confirmation."
StartConnectText="Start Journey and connect campaign"
StartConfirmText="Start and connect"
StartWarning="This Journey is Upcoming. Confirming starts it online first, then connects this campaign and applies the reviewed effects. Loading an older save or cancelling after the request does not undo an online start. If the reply is lost, Retry checks its current state before continuing."
StartUnavailableText="This Upcoming Journey cannot be started with the current connection. Use companion 0.5.0 and the updated API, then issue a new Journey credential in the portal (management permission is included automatically). Older credentials remain valid for already-Started Journeys; rotation does not add permissions. You can also start the Journey manually in the portal."
FinishedText="This Journey is Finished. Reopen it explicitly in the portal if you intend to continue; connecting from XCOM does not automatically reopen a Journey."
ChangedCharacteristicsText="The Journey started online, but the commander's characteristics changed since your preview. Review the refreshed effects and confirm again before applying any campaign bonuses."
FailedText="Could not connect the campaign: "

