LostSuppliesText="Some supplies were scattered, lost, or taken before recovery."

[TNB_AvengerJourneyPrompt]
PromptTitle="The Name Beneath - Connect a Journey?"
PromptText="This campaign has no connected Journey. Connect one to review and apply your commander bonuses; linking soldiers is optional. Nothing is applied until you review and confirm. Not now dismisses this reminder for this play session. You can always connect through Mod Config Menu > The Name Beneath > Campaign Journey, or disable reminders there for this campaign."
ConnectNowText="Connect now"
NotNowText="Not now"
